# Nothing in this project is compiled, bundled or installed, so there is no
# build output, lockfile or dependency folder to keep out. What is left is the
# debris that the operating system, the sync client and editors leave lying
# next to the source.

# Windows and OneDrive
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.lnk
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# macOS, should the folder ever be opened from one
.DS_Store
._*

# Editors and their scratch files
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# Claude Code's folder, all of it. The granted tool permissions are a fact
# about one computer, and launch.json only describes how to serve the site for
# preview - the site is static files with no build step, so nothing here
# depends on it. The folder stays on disk; it just does not belong in history.
.claude/
